Testing Steps:
Open the LSR application and navigate to the Portfolio – Overview screen.
Please do regression testing for the LSR application and verify the existing functionality after the Vulnerability Fixes (V3 & V4).
Select the required Entity Level and entities, provide the required Formula under the Calc By tab, and provide the required date/filter criteria under the Filter By tab.
Navigate to the Overview tab and click the Refresh button to calculate and fetch the returns.
Verify that the returns are calculated and displayed correctly and that there are no unexpected UI, functional, or data-access changes due to the vulnerability fixes.
